obj_id: BannerTest4-6d814cc2
liveboard:
  name: Banner Test 4
  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: 04a68f30-9e76-40aa-9bbb-b1b6fb855b6e
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • Central region shows concerning 7.9% profit margin vs 14.9% in West region despite $501K in sales
        • South region has lowest sales volume at $392K, representing significant market opportunity
        • West and East regions drive 61% of total revenue ($1.4M of $2.3M) with strong 13-15% margins

        Recommendations:
        • Investigate Central region cost structure and pricing to improve 7.9% margin toward company average of 12.5%
        • Expand sales efforts in South region given healthy 11.9% margin but low $392K volume
